This directory vendors ONLY scripts/detector/ from impeccable version 3.7.1,
the anti-pattern detector that design-impeccable-check.py runs. Nothing else
from the skill is included. File mode needs Node only. URL mode (a real
browser, computed styles) additionally needs puppeteer, which is not vendored:
    npm install puppeteer
run from vendor/impeccable/.
